OL,3,GNEWSA'It's like living in the woods' -
OL,4,Aresidents call for cull of 60ft trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in a Staffordshire Moorlands
OL,7,Fvillage say they are being hemmed in by
OL,8,Ftowering trees that "block out the sky"
OL,9,Fand leave them feeling like they're
OL,10,F"living in the woods".
OL,12,FSome of the trees, which were planted
OL,13,Fby a neighbouring school about a decade
OL,14,Fago, are estimated to be more than 60ft
OL,15,F(18m) tall.
OL,17,FMaureen Forsyth, who has lived on
OL,18,FUttoxeter Road in the village of Tean
OL,19,Ffor three years, said she feared if one
OL,20,Ffell "it would not just damage the
OL,21,Fhouse but could put lives at risk".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
