OL,3,GNEWSA'It's like living in the woods' -
OL,4,Aresidents call for cull of 60ft trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreatwood Community Primary School said
OL,7,Fit took management of all trees on site
OL,8,F"very seriously" and regularly
OL,9,Fcommissioned safety surveys and
OL,10,Freports.
